<title>SWITZERLAND: Saurer 8-month net profit 22.3 mln Sfr.</title>
<headline>Saurer 8-month net profit 22.3 mln Sfr.</headline>
<dateline>ARBON, Switzerland 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>January 1-August 31, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			22.3 plus	 vs 6.4 loss</p>
<p> Sales			    1,031.4	   vs 1,060.7</p>
<p> Operating profit	     31.0 plus	 vs 23.1 loss</p>
<p> Sales by sector</p>
<p> Textile machinery	    784.8	     vs 831.8</p>
<p> Components		     246.6	     vs 228.9</p>
<p> Op profit by sector</p>
<p> Textile machinery	    20.7 plus	 vs 26.9 loss</p>
<p> Components		     18.3		vs 15.2</p>
<p>Note - Full company name is Saurer Group Holding AG. Textile business includes spinning and embroidery machines. The components sector consists of transmission systems and surface metallurgy.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
